WEBVTT

00:02:27.863 --> 00:02:30.130
We think we're the only
creatures on the planet

00:02:30.163 --> 00:02:35.130
who have things like language,
reason, free will.

00:02:36.763 --> 00:02:41.330
By contrast, nonhuman things, to us,
are just part of nature,

00:02:41.363 --> 00:02:43.530
a mere backdrop to human culture,

00:02:43.563 --> 00:02:47.897
a mere environment of things
that we feel entitled to use

00:02:47.897 --> 00:02:49.297
however we want.

00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:51.663
And third:

00:02:53.563 --> 00:02:56.030
What does it mean to be a human
in our real world?

00:02:56.063 --> 00:02:58.730
Well, it means being an individual,

00:02:58.730 --> 00:03:02.030
a person who lives ultimately for oneself.